    Assertion:a-printed-sheet-mints,sentence:a printed sheet mints three one-time serials under one blotter — each a single-use ticket never a chain
    Assertion:the-first-torn-serial,sentence:the first torn serial seals a real friendship and spends only itself — its siblings on the sheet stay unclaimed
